# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages redirect rules.
#
# We link to clean URLs in the footer and sitemap (/privacy, /terms) so the
# canonical URLs match the address bar. Without these rewrites, those paths
# would 404 because the static host can only serve the literal .html files.
#
# `200` is a rewrite (URL stays clean in the browser); `301` would be a
# redirect (URL changes to .html). We want rewrites.

/privacy   /privacy.html   200
/terms     /terms.html     200
